Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:12.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Wait... without going through me—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:20.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.92,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Brute forcing your way into using \Nthe shield's secret art...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.99,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're a hell of a guy, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:34.45,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Is that you, Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:40.75,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's been a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:47.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.73,0:01:00.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Please, get out of here quickly. \NIt won't be down for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'll buy you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:05.94,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:12.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for lying to you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:19.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And thank you for everything, Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:20.94,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:23.52,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:26.98,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:40.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's already back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:44.77,main,Northern,0,0,0,,You didn't think it'd be that easy, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up! Let's do this, Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:50.81,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah! You should be able to use it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.81,0:01:53.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right! I'm counting on you, partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.54,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,Grand Cross Returnable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Grand Cross Returnable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:31.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.78,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400)\blur1\c&H0E00DD&\pos(473.437,285)}Devouring
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Now it's ensnared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.85,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:47.17,main,Northern,0,0,0,,That was clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.19,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Immobilizing the Divine Dragon \Nwith some art I'd never seen before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:53.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now we can actually fight one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,He's pushing me back...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:04:00.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My stats must have dropped \Nfrom using that secret art!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.35,main,Northern,0,0,0,,There are three reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:08.41,main,Northern,0,0,0,,One: By forcing your way into the \NDomain of E, you're exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:12.23,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Two: You're devoting a portion of \Nyour strength to maintaining that art.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:13.32,main,Northern,0,0,0,,And three...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:15.86,main,Northern,0,0,0,,I haven't gotten serious yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:21.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:23.57,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Well, that was dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:26.15,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Stick close! Don't let him get any distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:27.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:31.53,main,Northern,0,0,0,,What a desperate offense. \NRushing headlong into your attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.62,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:37.38,main,Northern,0,0,0,,If you get too far away, you won't \Nbe able to maintain that art of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:40.93,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Looks like I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:44.57,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Panicking now that I've seen through you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:46.97,main,Northern,0,0,0,,A swing that wide leaves you wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:58.71,main,Northern,0,0,0,,What a shame. I believe this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:02.38,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Eris seemed to have high hopes for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:05.24,main,Northern,0,0,0,,But after all the trouble you've caused me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:09.50,main,Northern,0,0,0,,you'll have to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.08,main,Northern,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:16.24,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Illusion magic...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:20.48,main,Northern,0,0,0,,When did you—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:25.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I thought you'd let your guard down \Nonce you were confident you'd won.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:29.64,main,Northern,0,0,0,,No... then you sacrificed your arm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:32.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It was an all-or-nothing gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:35.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You can have my left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:39.64,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Take it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:46.26,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:50.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:52.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I think I've seen this before...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:55.29,main,Luna,0,0,0,,And after all the times \NI tried to warn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.55,0:05:59.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You're... that girl that was Haniel's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:04.84,main,Luna,0,0,0,,My name is Luna. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.71,main,Luna,0,0,0,,For killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:14.75,main,Luna,0,0,0,,Don't look so sad. \NI think it was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:19.32,main,Luna,0,0,0,,But... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.53,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What are you apologizing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.08,main,Luna,0,0,0,,I can't do much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.04,main,Luna,0,0,0,,I'd been holding it back in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:37.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then it was thanks to you that \Nthe Gluttony skill had quieted down?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.49,0:06:42.32,main,Luna,0,0,0,,But not anymore. \NI'm not able to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:44.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Support...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:48.56,main,Luna,0,0,0,,If you devour the Divine Dragon, \Nyou'll lose control of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.64,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then soon I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:01.13,main,Greed,0,0,0,,I was wondering why you'd gone quiet. \NSo you were in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:04.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:12.57,main,Greed,0,0,0,,Don't stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:14.00,main,Greed,0,0,0,,We're running out of time. Gotta head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,H-Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thank you for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:24.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But I can't let the Divine Dragon \Nroam free without its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:28.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm going to slay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:29.85,main,Luna,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:40.20,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're a real handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So, you used to be a person, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:44.48,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Think of it as a temporary form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.32,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You ready to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.62,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Because we've got a rampaging \NDivine Dragon to deal with!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:08:00.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't know how long I've got left. \NWe'll end this fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:03.89,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What's the plan? Kinda hard to use \Na shield or bow with one arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:05.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Oh, dammit, don't tell me—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You ever want to fly before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:13.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What the hell, Fate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:20.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Brawl Art: Ruinous Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:28.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Treating me like a throwing weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Come on, I got you back, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.79,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Oh, this isn't over, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:33.49,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's Identify this thing!
