Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.36,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I've got a slight edge in stats, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:42.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The Domain of E is the world of inhuman \Nstrength. I wouldn't trust numbers too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:45.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,In that case, let's focus on what we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:50.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:04.24,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:09.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sharp Edge enhanced with the Might skill \Nthat doubles your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:18.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:28.83,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.50,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:39.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Can't... let it take me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.70,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,If I go berserk now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:47.48,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'll become a bigger threat \Nthan the Divine Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.57,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Before... that happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:01.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You... a-are you—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:07.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't... hold on much longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:11.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So before I'm lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:13.51,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Stop. Don't! Don't do this, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:16.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:26.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Accessing your new level has reset my stats.
