Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(15.153,201.511)}Magic:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(15.153,242.768)}Spirit:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(15.518,280.374)}Agility:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(360.436,84.374)}[Skills]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(241.293,116.874)}Gluttony, Identify, Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(241.293,141.497)}Conceal, Night Vision, Brawler,\NHoly Sword Technique
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.36,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(241.293,182.456)}One-Handed Sword Technique,\N Two-Handed Sword Technique
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:32.94,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now, even if I go berserk... \Nthe damage will be minimized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:37.84,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,In the end... the skill's devouring you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.65,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I didn't think this day would come so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:06.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:10.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Kill me, Myne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:15.43,main,Myne,0,0,0,,If you push too hard, the skill overwhelms \Nyou, making you lose control...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.43,0:11:17.07,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:19.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:22.47,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.08,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I'll keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.39,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:49.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:51.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:59.03,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Are you seriously asking me that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.99,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,What were you trying to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:09.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I never wanted you to see me like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:14.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:20.01,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Did you really think this would be enough \Nto make me hate you, Fay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.72,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,No matter what power you wield, \Nyou're still the Fay I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:29.09,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,So... don't try to kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.08,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,It's so strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:36.07,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The Gluttony skill was rampaging before,\N but it's quiet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:42.82,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.30,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Let's return to Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:53.72,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I was afraid... of her hating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:59.53,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But she still accepts me, \Neven after learning the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:04.04,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I kept saying I wanted to save Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:10.98,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But the truth is, I wanted her \Nto save me... like she did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:30.66,italics,Luna,0,0,0,,You've found your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.50,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,None for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.68,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Oh, would you pipe down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:58.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My room at the inn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:02.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right... Northern cut my left arm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's already noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How long was I asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:12.25,main,Eris,0,0,0,,A whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Eris...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:17.00,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Still worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:20.38,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You sleep too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:24.76,main,Eris,0,0,0,,You can't blame him,\Nconsidering how overboard he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:26.22,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Here, you forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.22,0:14:27.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:31.09,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You just now remembered \NI was missing, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:32.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,O-Obviously not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I have to say, you're looking pretty messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:40.32,main,Eris,0,0,0,,We had to go into the central \Npart of Galia to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:42.26,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't he be dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:45.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I seriously thought I wasn't \Ngonna make it back...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:47.40,main,Miria,0,0,0,,It was really far. A huge pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.53,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What was he doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.78,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I think a monster carried him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:54.20,main,Eris,0,0,0,,All because Myne forgot to collect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:58.75,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I was busy dealing with the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.36,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:01.53,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:04.29,main,Eris,0,0,0,,It'd be a bad idea if he found \Nanother vessel like Northern
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.47,main,Eris,0,0,0,,and started causing trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:09.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Vessel? What was going on with \NNorthern and Envy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.89,main,Myne,0,0,0,,He was just being controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:15.10,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Like a puppet, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:17.81,main,Eris,0,0,0,,The one calling the shots \Nwas the Black Gun-Sword, Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:21.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Envy was in control? \NDid you know that, Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:25.11,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Nope. I had no idea \Nhe could use mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:29.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,But considering how twisted he is, \Nit doesn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:31.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Mind control, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:33.67,main,Eris,0,0,0,,We obviously couldn't just ignore that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You went and destroyed him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.13,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Weapons of Mortal Sin can't be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:42.58,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What'd you do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.84,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Threw him to the far side of Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The most meat-headed solution possible...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.06,main,Eris,0,0,0,,That aside, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.29,main,Eris,0,0,0,,After defeating the Divine Dragon, \Nyou've proven your potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:04.11,main,Eris,0,0,0,,We'd like your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:10.36,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Well, the plan to manufacture a crowned \Nhuman with Roxy's death is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:15.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Swear to me that you'll never go \Nafter Lady Roxy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'll hear you out after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:22.81,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Deal. Envy was the one who \Ncame up with the idea, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:26.55,main,Eris,0,0,0,,And looking back now, \NI was a fool to go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:32.04,main,Eris,0,0,0,,With the Divine Dragon gone,\Nthe country will be entering a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:34.42,main,Eris,0,0,0,,And we'll need your help \Nfor what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:37.02,main,Eris,0,0,0,,That said, you're in no position to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.48,main,Eris,0,0,0,,This is something that all Skill of \NDeadly Sin wielders have to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:51.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean by all of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:54.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But since I was born with the Gluttony skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:58.25,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I think there must be some reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.04,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And I want to know that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:10.08,main,Eris,0,0,0,,But first... let's do something \Nabout that arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:11.75,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Fix my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:14.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I've never heard of magic like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:15.22,main,Eris,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:17.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'll have my arm back...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:22.13,main,Eris,0,0,0,,With that settled, let's get out of here \Nbefore Roxy comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:23.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:26.57,main,Eris,0,0,0,,It's dangerous for you \Nto be around her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:32.12,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Just hearing her name was enough \Nto stir Gluttony, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.85,0:17:36.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.20,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:43.03,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Keep those feet moving, Miria!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:46.92,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Raine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:48.88,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,What?! Where? Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:50.60,main,Miria,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:54.45,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:55.60,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,That was dirty, Miria!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:58.00,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Heading out, Lady Roxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:17:59.81,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Yes. Look after things while I'm away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:02.50,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Sure! Have a good trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:06.15,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Bet she's going to see that bonehead again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:09.56,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,It's already been a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.45,main,Unmarked Crowd Noise,0,0,0,,Hey there, step on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:23.75,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Look, Fay, I saw some grapes today and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.43,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:34.18,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:42.34,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Forgive me for suddenly \Ndisappearing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:54.56,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I never told you \Nabout my Gluttony skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:58.20,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And... thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:04.67,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I have to leave for now, but I promise \NI will return to you, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.95,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Please, take care until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.68,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:14.28,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Struggling with something \Nlike this by himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:19.59,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,And when you were the one \Nwho gave me so much courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:36.99,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.91,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to be wandering \Nabout at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.34,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,You need to run on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.20,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! Please don't hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:47.67,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Hit you? Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:51.63,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,B-Because I made a holy knight mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:53.59,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,I was just giving you a warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.59,0:19:55.30,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:04.18,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,The people really do fear \Nthe holy knights, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.42,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:09.19,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:14.09,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,I... am ashamed to be a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.11,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:21.60,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:29.99,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Okay, now once you finish eating,\N head on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:32.21,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm sure your family is worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.27,0:20:36.60,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't have one. A family or a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.94,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,But I'll get going. \NThank you for the sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.35,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Do you have somewhere to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:49.47,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Nope. But now I know \Nthe capital isn't all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:53.56,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm real glad I met such a nice holy knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:57.41,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.66,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Wait! What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:01.20,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Fate! Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.79,0:21:03.16,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:10.02,italics,Roxy,0,0,0,,That was the moment I became able to hold my \Nhead up and be proud of being a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:15.93,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We will meet again, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.05,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'll need to get stronger, \Nfor when the day comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:24.60,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You'll see, Fay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:31.07,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Then Corpse was Fate all along...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.07,0:21:33.60,main,Memil,0,0,0,,That's quite the shock, isn't it, Rafale?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:34.44,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:38.49,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,I have research left to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:46.25,main,Memil,0,0,0,,What exactly does he do during \Nall this research of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.37,0:21:55.83,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,I'm glad you killed Hado...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.31,0:21:58.89,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:15.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Take 40% of what I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:22.57,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,This is the secret art of my \N4th level, Twilight Healing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:30.92,main,Fate,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:33.96,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.64,0:22:36.31,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I'll see you back at the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.49,0:22:39.81,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I should get going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:05.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We just got you a new scabbard, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.49,0:23:09.89,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,Except that now you're an exceptional \Nwarrior who's made it into the Domain of E.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:12.63,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,So you need to have a sword to match!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:17.17,top,Fate,0,0,0,,So what? You're not satisfied with regular \Nwhetstones? You need the fancy kind now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.17,0:23:20.92,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yep! I'm thinking a carbuncle \Nwhetstone would be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:22.87,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A good reflection of how awesome I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.87,0:23:25.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And where are we supposed to \Nget the money for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.19,0:23:27.94,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If we don't have it now, \Nwe've just gotta earn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:30.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.87,0:23:32.56,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's do this, partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:36.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah! Fight like the glutton you are!
